# Phase 6.5 — deployment pipeline fix (Prompt 13). Vercel's default,
# zero-config API routing turns every non-underscore-prefixed .js file
# under api/ into its own serverless function — that convention already
# excludes helper modules (api/_auth.js, api/portal/_case-list.js, etc.)
# but NOT *.test.js files, which don't start with an underscore
# themselves. Confirmed root cause of "exceeded_serverless_functions_
# per_deployment" (Hobby plan's 12-function cap): 12 real routes +
# 6 non-underscore api/**/*.test.js files were all being counted as
# functions. This doesn't touch any route file, handler, or security
# boundary — it only tells Vercel's build to skip test files it was
# never meant to deploy as routes in the first place.
api/**/*.test.js
